; Halvard, joiner (Phase 38L) - the first merchant in the game who sells the 37C placeable kits, which
; have existed since Phase 37 and until now could only be crafted.
;
; No NEW placeable is authored here, deliberately: a PlaceableItemResource needs a matching id and Build
; case in src/Housing/PlaceableTemplates.cs, which is code rather than content, and 38L is a content
; sub-phase. His oak plank is a plain trade good wearing `furnishing` and needs nothing at all.
;
; The workbench kit sits behind one rung - a stake in a joiner's yard buys you the yard's own tools.

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Stock_plank"]
script = ExtResource("2_entry")
ItemId = "item.material.oak_plank"
Quantity = 0

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Stock_crate"]
script = ExtResource("2_entry")
